  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing walk the fourth inner city of Shang clan city, the air feels more humid and cooler than the fifth. Vines named Moonlight crawling mountain tiger climb the walls on both sides of the street and spread everywhere; their roots are deep blue, and their wide leaves each give off a small blue moonlight, so one street segment can hold thousands of leaves whose gentle blue light merges into one. The leaf mass also thickens water vapor into near-ground mist, and moonlight refracting in that mist turns into an aurora, so walking the streets feels like a spiritual realm.",
        "chapters": [
          261
        ],
